  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1211\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1209\">CD57 Positive:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1282\">\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1282\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Often marks <strong data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1279\">natural killer (NK) cells and subset of T-cells</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1442\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Used in evaluation of <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1370\">NK/T-cell disorders, chronic lymphoproliferative diseases</strong>, and sometimes <strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1421\">prognostic assessment in tumors</strong> (context-dependent).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<p data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1466\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1464\">CD57 Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<p data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1536\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Absence of significant NK/T-cell population in the tested tissue.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1658\">\n<p data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1567\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1565\">Clinical Correlation:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1658\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1658\">\n<p data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1658\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Must be interpreted alongside other <strong data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1657\">IHC markers, histology, and clinical findings</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
